  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9306b621eeae437439044a22699d6427, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Little one,

    My babies have bloomed into magnificent
    flowers, but I wish there were more of them.

    I am certain that you can make
    a Botanic Rush, it will allow me duplicate my babies. I cannot wait to see my
    house turn into a sumptuous garden! Just imagine plants and flowers growing all
    over the place, I would get swarmed by my babies!

    Sincerely,'
  <LetterType>k__BackingField: 0
